| 4  | A pack of 1d6 Wolves, on the hunt.           |
| 5  | Evidence of a passing Owlbear, but no creature. |
| 6  | A hidden shrine to a forgotten deity.        |

## Combat Tactics
When designing combat, consider the environment, monster abilities, and player strengths. Use cover, elevation, and terrain to make battles more dynamic.

### Magic Items
*   **Potion of Healing:** Restores 2d4+2 hit points.
*   **Sentinel Shield:** While holding this shield, you have advantage on initiative rolls and Wisdom (Perception) checks.
*   **Flame Tongue (Longsword):** As a bonus action, you can speak the command word to cause flames to erupt from the blade.

